0f&oh=00_Af_UJm3MIOLLGyGZj-1vdQ61G2lqZPnZwAAJ5cc7cxDqGQ&oe=6A36B60C"}, "display_name": "Escape The Cube", "keywords": ["puzzle", "horror", "escape", "room", "survival"], "long_description": "**Try to escape from rooms filled with unique puzzles and mechanics.\nThrills against time and an atmosphere blended with horror elements await you!**\n\n**DEMO VERSION Link:** https://vr.meta.me/s/2olf0bWAF8stA2i\n- Playing the 2-level demo version and leaving a comment will help us a lot while we develop the game. We\u2019re looking forward to your feedback!\n\n{1516271360074646}\n**Strange sounds echo around you, eerie reflections distort reality, and an unsettling atmosphere surrounds everything. Experience it in full.**\n{1340574611222431}\n**Sometimes simple, sometimes hiding in plain sight\u2014so obvious you\u2019ll wonder how you missed it\u2014and sometimes demanding intense focus and thought, the puzzles will test you at every turn.**\n{826274706669169}\n**In a tense, unsettling environment, you must control your emotions while solving the puzzles. Any rushed or thoughtless move will turn the rooms into places you can never escape.**\n\n\n", "short_description": "Escape the rooms by solving puzzles and staying calm!"}]}, "developer_name": "None Play Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "None Play Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://noneplaygames.com.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lan